Current Version can be found [https://undercards.fandom.com/wiki/Overgrowth here].

Overgrowth replaced [[Rage]] in '''Beta 42.0''' as a 4G that was able to give all monsters on your board and those in your hand that didn't start in your deck +1/+2. (Since Beta 51.1, these are known as Generated cards.) Cards that would be affected are visualized with a Gear Icon.

'''Beta 53.0''' nerfed it to only give +1/+1, but the cost was reduced to 3G and it now also targets your deck, thus it now targets all Generated monsters you own.

=== Stats ===
SOUL Type: Bravery

Cost:
* 4 (Post Beta 42.0)
* 3 (Post Beta 53.0, Current)
Effects:
* Give +1/+2 to all Generated monsters your board and hand has. (Post Beta 42.0)
* Give +1/+1 to all Generated monsters you own. (Post Beta 53.0, Current)
Rarity: Blue (Rare)
